50e74d87b235b65992a6be1eae109c680714c66b"}, "language": "english", "review": " this game is so good", "timestamp_created": 1784848531, "timestamp_updated": 1784848531, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "231158684", "author": {"steamid": "76561198137470781", "personaname": "Scorn—", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/scorn-/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 13, "playtime_forever": 15775, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1717, "last_played": 1789383859, "avatar": "ba2a49b5180c4f3449245bab40ea2a064898a013"}, "language": "english", "review": "10/10", "timestamp_created": 1784848275, "timestamp_updated": 1784848275, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "231158504", "author": {"steamid": "76561198070405321", "personaname": "makobane214", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/13L00D13ANE/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 8, "playtime_forever": 13049, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3167, "last_played": 1786687345, "avatar": "13e3385852caaafb77ae85e139f7809c34d8980f"}, "language": "english", "review": "Palworld isn't the Pokemon killer, Nintendo is. This is the game we have been wanting for decades, and since Nintendo refused to provide the player with what we were aching for, someone else finally made the next iteration/evolution of one of the all-time classics. \nPalworld combines base building, pal-catching, evolution/growth of pals, character agency, open-world, dynamic combat, and more in a mix that feels like it shouldn't work, but somehow it really does. \nTo the developer: thank you for not only making a fantastic game that melds nostalgia with something shiny and new, but also for sticking to your guns and refusing to back down even when the big dog tries everything in their power to shut you out and shut you down.\n\nNegatives/complaints:\nPlease please please allow first person view somehow without using a mod. Can't even say how many times I've been trying to focus on something and the pal is over my right shoulder, front and center of my screen.\nIt does annoy me that my own projectiles will be blocked by terrain/walls/my own pal, but pal abilities go through everything? Seems silly.\n", "timestamp_created": 1784848064, "timestamp_updated": 1785025316, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "231158436", "author": {"steamid": "76561198144866918", "personaname": "Billy Goat", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198144866918/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 25486, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 12304, "last_played": 1786245776, "avatar": "611559628e9c087857265755d6ce270ef26a137b"}, "language": "english", "review": "10/10 no notes", "timestamp_created": 1784847988, "timestamp_updated": 1784847988, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recomm